it?  Or did this this come from polypile/bones?  If you don't know 
charging, at least ID your existing scrolls before wishing for it.

HOB is an excellent wish, but wait until after you've checked the castle 
storeroom and the valley, and polypiled magic armor.  Also polypile 
spellbooks, rings, amulets, magic tools, and possibly some junk potions 
and scrolls (be careful not to use up too many this way).

Important spellbooks: ID, haste self, magic missile, magic mapping
If these four haven't shown up, keep polypiling.  You can succeed without 
them, but they make the game much easier.  Other spells to look out for 
include charm monster, detect monsters, force bolt, drain life, and cure 
sickness. 

Important rings: conflict.  If levitation shows up, grab it too.  TC is 
handy except you get it for free at level 17.

